{
    "name": "E2E Zoho - custom modules",
    "description": "Finds the custom modules of the organization, then reads the first one back with GetCustomModule and compares the two.",
    "notes": {
        "8acff89e-0a80-4afa-99cc-410fe752b980": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 384,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe Zoho CRM organization must have **at least one custom module** (paid editions only). With none, Find Custom Modules sends to `notFound` and the flow stops at the AfterAll timeout.\n\nOn a fresh tenant run **E2E Zoho - create custom module** once, or add a module in Setup → Customization → Modules and Fields.\n\nThe connected account needs the `ZohoCRM.settings.modules.READ` permission — reconnect the account in this flow if it was authorized before these components existed."
        }
    },
